## No legal advice

The content is a compilation of laws, regulations, standards and requirements for informational purposes. It does not replace advice from a lawyer, consultant or competent authority, and no client or advisory relationship is formed by using the site.

## Always verify the primary source

Provisions may have been amended, repealed or supplemented. Only the wording of the official source, such as the statute or regulation text, is binding. Consolidated texts and translations on the site are unofficial and provided for convenience only.

## Interpretations

Summaries, guides and categorizations on the site are simplifications and editorial selections. They may be incomplete, contain errors or reflect an interpretation that an authority or court does not share.

## Referenced standards

Standards and similar publications referenced in the database, such as SS, EN, ISO and IEC documents, are copyrighted works belonging to their publishers. The site describes and references them but does not reproduce their content. The binding text is obtained from the publisher.

## External content

Links lead to sources we do not control, such as authority websites and registers. The linked material may change or be removed without notice.

## Liability

To the extent permitted by applicable law, we accept no liability for losses, compliance failures or decisions based on the information here. Your own assessment against the primary source is always required.
